{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_obstruction_level","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_obstruction_level","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Archimedean","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Floor.Semiring"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_obstruction_level_least","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_obstruction_level_least","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L103-L110","doc":"**`n*` is the least failing level.** It is nonzero at `n*` and vanishes at\nevery smaller level — the manuscript's `n* = ⌊s*⌋ + 1` is exactly the\nminimal brane-tower level at which the classical velocity ceases to lift. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_no_obstruction_below","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_no_obstruction_below","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L91-L101","doc":"**Every level below `n*` lifts cleanly.** For `n < n* = ⌊s⌋ + 1`, i.e.\n`n ≤ ⌊s⌋ ≤ s`, the obstruction class vanishes (`¬ (s < n)`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_obstruction_at_level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.yekutieli_obstruction_at_level","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L82-L89","doc":"**Lifting fails at `n*`.** The obstruction class `κ_{n*}` does not vanish,\nbecause `s < ⌊s⌋ + 1 = n*`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.obstructionLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.obstructionLevel","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L78-L80","doc":"**The Yekutieli obstruction level** `n* = ⌊s⌋ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.obstruction_iff_exceeds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.obstruction_iff_exceeds","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L76-L76","doc":"**Mechanism (`p3-blowup-yekutieli`):** the level-`n` obstruction class is\nnonzero iff `n` exceeds the Sobolev regularity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.obstruction","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L73-L73","doc":"\"`κ_n(v) ≠ 0`\": lifting fails at brane-tower level `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.sobolev_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.sobolev_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Regularity is non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.sobolev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.sobolev","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L69-L69","doc":"Terminal Sobolev regularity `s(t)` of the velocity field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel.mk","kind":"ctor","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.YekutieliObstructionLevel","kind":"class","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/yekutieli_obstruction_level.lean#L58-L76","doc":"Yekutieli obstruction–Sobolev correspondence at a fixed time.\n\n`sobolev` is the terminal Sobolev regularity `s = s(t)` of the QOU-internal\n`q = 1` flow's velocity\n(`0 ≤ s`, finite — the finite-time-blow-up regime); `obstruction n` is the\nproposition \"`κ_n(v) ≠ 0`\", i.e. lifting fails at brane-tower level `n`. The\nsingle field `obstruction_iff_exceeds` is the manuscript's mechanism\n(`p3-blowup-yekutieli`): the level-`n` class is nonzero exactly when `n`\nexceeds the Sobolev regularity, so the `n`-th jet is undefined. ","signatureChunk":0}]}